# MCP configuration (tool-specific)
.mcp.json

# Claude Code harness artefacts (per-user settings, scheduled-task locks, etc.)
# `.claude/CLAUDE.md` is intentionally tracked (project instructions); the
# negation keeps it included while everything else under .claude/ is ignored.
.claude/*
!.claude/CLAUDE.md

